    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ev_t",
      "x": 36,
      "y": 562,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "policy sub-type must be Enhanced\n  a Trusted Launch VM refuses a Standard policy and fails with\n  UserErrorThisVMBackupIsSupportedUsingEnhancedPolicy\n  the sub-type cannot be changed after the policy is created\n\nsoft delete is AlwaysON, 14 days, not configurable\n  a vault holding only soft-deleted items can still be deleted in one pass",
      "originalText": "policy sub-type must be Enhanced\n  a Trusted Launch VM refuses a Standard policy and fails with\n  UserErrorThisVMBackupIsSupportedUsingEnhancedPolicy\n  the sub-type cannot be changed after the policy is created\n\nsoft delete is AlwaysON, 14 days, not configurable\n  a vault holding only soft-deleted items can still be deleted in one pass",
